:&lt;br&gt;requests p95 by operation ·&lt;br&gt;dependencies by vendor · CPU/concurrency" style="shape=image;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;imageAspect=0;aspect=fixed;image=data:image/svg+xml,;fontSize=10;fontColor=#24292F;labelBackgroundColor=none;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="100" y="180" width="52" height="52" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n57" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;curved=1;html=1;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#C25400;dashed=1;dashPattern=10 4;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#C25400;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;rounded=0;exitX=1;exitY=0.35;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.3;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n56" target="n25"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="430" y="205" /><mxPoint x="430" y="535" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n58" value="“The plan is not to be clever later. The seams are already cut —&lt;br&gt;Endpoints/ + Acl/ + shared Domain extract as a column;&lt;br&gt;the canonical Account contract never changes shape.”" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#59666F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="430" width="460" height="80" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="page7" name="A1 · Appendix — dense wiring view"><mxGraphModel dx="800" dy="600" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2680" pageHeight="1800" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="n1" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:22px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;dotnet-api-platform — the whole system, wired&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#59666F&quot; style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;One canvas: repos → pipelines → packages → runtime → vendors · the paved road from git push to governe